    <briefdescription>
<para>Multi-dimensional Conjugate Gradient class. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Fletcher-Reeves-Polak-Ribiere algorithm adapted from Numerical Recipes in C, 2nd edition.</para><para>User has to provide line-search method and optimization end criteria. Search direction <formula id="225">$ d_i = - f&apos;(x_i) + c_i*d_{i-1} $</formula> where <formula id="226">$ c_i = ||f&apos;(x_i)||^2/||f&apos;(x_{i-1})||^2 $</formula> and <formula id="227">$ d_1 = - f&apos;(x_1) $</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
